       *> COVENANT - record layout of Covenants (generated by rulebook-to-cobol).
       *> Use: COPY COVENANT REPLACING ==:P:== BY ==<prefix>== under a level
       *> 01-10 group. Record length: 674 bytes.
       *> A NULL field has <name>-NI = "Y"; text is <name>-LEN bytes of <name>;
       *> booleans are "Y"/"N"; numbers are packed decimal.
       *> Name (calculated, string)
           15 :P:-NAME-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-NAME-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-NAME PIC X(129).
       *> Loan (relationship, string)
           15 :P:-LOAN-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-LOAN PIC X(64).
       *> CovenantType (raw, string)
           15 :P:-COVENANT-TYPE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-COVENANT-TYPE PIC X(64).
       *> ThresholdValue (raw, float)
           15 :P:-THRESHOLD-VALUE-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-THRESHOLD-VALUE PIC S9(9)V9(2) COMP-3.
       *> TestFrequency (raw, string)
           15 :P:-TEST-FREQUENCY-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-TEST-FREQUENCY PIC X(64).
       *> NextTestDate (raw, string)
           15 :P:-NEXT-TEST-DATE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-NEXT-TEST-DATE PIC X(64).
       *> Status (raw, string)
           15 :P:-STATUS-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-STATUS PIC X(64).
       *> CurrentWaiverThrough (raw, string)
           15 :P:-CURRENT-WAIVER-THROUGH-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-CURRENT-WAIVER-THROUGH-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-CURRENT-WAIVER-THROUGH PIC X(64).
       *> LoanLabel (lookup, string)
           15 :P:-LOAN-LABEL-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-LOAN-LABEL-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-LOAN-LABEL PIC X(64).
       *> LoanBusiness (lookup, string)
           15 :P:-LOAN-BUSINESS-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-LOAN-BUSINESS-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-LOAN-BUSINESS PIC X(64).
       *> IsBreached (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-IS-BREACHED-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-IS-BREACHED PIC X.
       *> HasActiveWaiver (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-HAS-ACTIVE-WAIVER-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-HAS-ACTIVE-WAIVER PIC X.
